HUMAN: Weapons round analysed — persistent upgrade tiers, gun-mode cycling, richer missile economy, timed shield overdrive.
FIND F31 sev=H tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html:9167-9172#"missilesStart: 3" what="user: more missiles + faster re-earning" fix="missilesStart 3->5, missilesMax 6->12, missileEarnInterval default 24->14 seconds (grep its init; line 10050 divides by it); reward missiles from targets +1 across the board (grep rewardMissiles values in traffic presets and bump each by 1)" ref=flight-sim3.html:10049-10056#"missileEarnBank" dep=-
FIND F32 sev=H tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html:9160-9175#"combatState" what="user: keep upgraded weapons, keep improving them — no persistence or progression exists" fix="weapon progression persisted at localStorage 'e115-weapon-tiers-v1' {gun:0..3, msl:0..3, xpKills, xpScore}: tiers auto-advance on lifetime milestones (kills 10/30/75 -> gun tier ups; missile kills or score 1500/5000/12000 -> msl tier ups; read+merge on boot, write on change, NEVER reset on death/reset). Tier effects applied where stats are read, not stored: gun tier -> fireCooldown x(1/0.85/0.72/0.6), spread tightened, ammoMax +0/60/120/200, ammoEarnRate +0/2/4/6; msl tier -> missilesMax +0/2/4/6 (on top of F31), lock speed x(1/1.15/1.3/1.5), missileCooldown x(1/0.9/0.8/0.7); flashStatus 'GUNS UPGRADED · TIER n' on advance; HUD GUNS/MSL chips show tier pips (I-III)" ref=flight-sim3.html:9764#"missileCooldown",flight-sim3.html:17196#"$weaponMode" dep=F31
FIND F33 sev=M tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html:17196-17216#"$weaponMode" what="user: maybe cycle through them — weapon-mode HUD element exists (hidden) but no cycling" fix="gun fire-mode cycling on KeyB (grep keys usage to confirm B free; fallback KeyU): modes unlocked by gun tier — STANDARD (t0), RAPID (t1: 0.6x cooldown, 1.4x spread, 2x ammo use), HEAVY (t2: 2.2x damage, 1.8x cooldown, tighter spread), SCATTER (t3: 5-round fan, 3x ammo use); mode stored in combatState.gunMode, persisted with tiers; weapon-mode HUD label unhidden showing mode name; fire code branches on mode at the existing projectile spawn site" ref=flight-sim3.html:2247#"weapon-mode" dep=F32
FIND F34 sev=M tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html:12593#"shieldMax: 150" what="user: shield upgrade but limited time" fix="SHIELD OVERDRIVE: charge-based timed powerup — combatState.overdriveCharges (max 2, start 1; +1 charge from HEAVY SAUCER kills and every 3rd course gate reward); KeyO (or free key) activates: 14s of shieldMax 150->300, shield topped to max, absorb-all (skip the 0.42 hull softening path... keep simple: shield just much larger), amber HUD SHD bar + countdown ring on the chip; on expiry shieldMax back to 150, shield clamped; charges persist in the same localStorage blob; nhud SHD label pulses during overdrive" ref=flight-sim3.html:12636#"plane.shield = Math.max(0, plane.shield - shieldAbsorb)",flight-sim3.html:9964#"plane.shieldMax = Math.max(150" dep=-
OPEN O7 q="tier persistence scope: per-browser localStorage OK (no accounts exist)? assume yes" default=localStorage
DONE stage=F find=4 open=1 tok~=560
